          "text": "Some spicy info  • Net debt-to-equity ratio projected at just 18% by 2029 despite heavy capex   • Reiterate our July 2’s report of Nvidia cutting memory: Vera CPU SOCAMM from 192GB → 96GB → selective SKUs to 64GB by 1Q27  • Rubin Ultra HBM stepped down from 384GB to",
